# 📖 Project Overview

Financial institutions need to identify high-risk customers while maintaining a healthy lending portfolio. This project builds an end-to-end analytics solution that combines data analysis, machine learning, and business intelligence to assess customer risk and support data-driven lending decisions.

Using a retail banking dataset of **3,000 customers**, the project performs data cleaning, exploratory analysis, feature engineering, customer risk scoring, and interactive reporting through Power BI.

---

# 🎯 Business Objective

The goal of this project is to help banks:

- Identify customers with high lending risk
- Generate continuous customer risk scores
- Prioritize customers requiring immediate attention
- Monitor loan and deposit portfolios through interactive dashboards
- Support informed credit and relationship management decisions

