# 📊 Dataset

The dataset contains information for approximately **3,000 banking customers**, including:

- Customer Demographics
- Banking Relationships
- Loans
- Deposits
- Savings & Checking Accounts
- Credit Card Information
- Business Lending
- Internal Risk Weighting

The Power BI solution uses multiple relational tables, while the machine learning workflow uses a consolidated dataset for modeling.

---

# 🔍 Exploratory Data Analysis

The analysis focused on understanding data quality and customer financial behavior through:

- Data quality assessment
- Missing value analysis
- Duplicate detection
- Outlier identification (IQR)
- Distribution analysis
- Correlation analysis
- Customer profile exploration

---

# ⚡ Feature Engineering

To improve model performance, domain-specific financial features were created, including:

| Feature | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| Credit Utilization | Credit balance relative to income |
| Loan-to-Income Ratio | Customer debt burden |
| Deposit-to-Loan Ratio | Financial liquidity indicator |
| Cards per Income | Credit dependency |
| Total Accounts | Overall banking relationship |
| Customer Tenure | Relationship duration |
| Income Band | Customer segmentation |

---

# 🤖 Machine Learning

A Logistic Regression model was built using a Scikit-Learn Pipeline with automated preprocessing.

### Model Pipeline

- Missing Value Imputation
- Feature Scaling
- One-Hot Encoding
- Logistic Regression
- Customer Risk Scoring

### Model Performance

| Metric | Score |
|---------|-------|
| ROC-AUC | **0.891** |
| Accuracy | **81.6%** |
| Precision | **0.684** |
| Recall | **0.771** |

Each customer receives:

- Risk Score
- Risk Band (Low / Medium / High)
- Risk Decile

to support continuous risk assessment.

---

# 📈 Power BI Dashboard

The Power BI report provides an interactive view of banking performance across four pages:

- 🏠 Home
- 💰 Loan Analysis
- 🏦 Deposit Analysis
- 📊 Executive Summary

Key business KPIs include:

- Total Clients
- Total Loans
- Total Deposits
- Business Lending
- Credit Card Balance
- Processing Fees
- Customer Engagement
- Account Distribution

---

# 💡 Key Business Insights

- Ratio-based financial features improve customer risk assessment compared to raw balances.
- Customer risk scores enable better prioritization than traditional risk categories.
- High-risk customers with weak liquidity buffers can be identified proactively.
- Interactive dashboards allow business users to monitor portfolio performance without technical expertise.

